          "text": "1. Down the Await Chain",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "An await chain goes down nested coroutines to a ==pending Future==",
            "`Future.__await__` yields **the Future itself**",
            "That yield travels up through every `await` to the Task",
            "The whole coroutine stack is now __suspended__"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "chain",
          "spec": {
