                "text": "Task",
                "note": "drives via send()",
                "ink": "purple"
              },
              {
                "text": "main()",
                "note": "await fetch()"
              },
              {
                "text": "fetch()",
                "note": "await read()"
              },
              {
                "text": "Future (pending)",
                "note": "yields itself ↑",
                "ink": "red"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Suspend & Resume",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Task gets the Future, calls `add_done_callback(self.__wakeup)`",
            "Then it ==returns to the loop==: other tasks run",
            "I/O or a timer calls `fut.set_result(x)`",
            "Callback schedules `Task.__step`; `send()` resumes **after** the await"
          ],
          "style": "number",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. sleep(0) & Interleaving",
