        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "A CPU loop with no `await` **can't** be timed out",
            "Swallowing ==CancelledError== inside breaks the timeout",
            "Timing out a `to_thread` call leaves the thread __running__",
            "Catching TimeoutError inside the block: it never arrives there"
